script = ExtResource("1_boss")
id = &"qi_body_integration_warden"
display_name = "Body Integration Warden"
domain_id = &"qi_body_integration_trial"
## The hearth's authored cost (ADR 0146): a player must be able to afford the structure
## that repairs a damaged soul. Declared in `loot_qi_body_integration_warden` and the
## pools it draws, which the encounter binds by name. `BossDef.loot` is NOT also a
## declaration: it is the LEGACY projection, and a boss carrying both leaves two
## authorities answering what it drops, which `acquisition validate` rejects.
